      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW HART (8) had been going along well winning a Grade 5 three back then placing at Temora before missing the frame latest when fifth (19.06) at Temora. Can make amends this time. PAY TIME (1) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (18.24) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning eight races. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Hard to beat again. SHIFTY BULLDOZER (2) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on his dynamic win the start prior, getting around this track over 400m in 22.66. Rates a leading chance if runs up to recent winning time. GOODBYE MATE (4) was below best last time at Gosford (30.13) in a Mix 1/2/3, finishing a 6 length seventh. Has already won six times from this draw.",
